The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.

Short description
-----------------

stress_work1

 Steady Stokes flow and temperature problem with viscous dissipation.
 Periodic pipe flow. Constant coefficients.
 Error compared to analytical solution for velocity and temperature.

stress_work2

 Steady Stokes flow and temperature problem with viscous dissipation.
 Periodic pipe flow with circumferential velocity included (swirl).
 Constant coefficients.
 Error compared to analytical solution for velocity and temperature (swirl
 only).

stress_work3

 Start-up of an Oldroyd-B fluid flow and temperature problem with stress work
 for the steady state.
 Periodic pipe flow. Constant coefficients.
 Error compared to analytical solution for velocity, conformation and
 temperature.

stress_work4

 Start-up of an Oldroyd-B fluid flow and temperature problem with stress work
 for the steady state.
 Periodic pipe flow with circumferential velocity included (swirl).
 Constant coefficients.
 Error compared to analytical solution for velocity, conformation and
 temperature (swirl only).
